<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LAWCAT: Efficient Distillation from Quadratic to <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">L</span>inear <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">A</span>ttention <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">w</span>ith <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">C</span>onvolution <span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">a</span>cross <span id="id6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">T</span>okens for Long Context Modeling</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
